Third-party notices for the herdr-slack-inbox binary

The herdr-slack-inbox binary in the release archives is compiled from
bin/herdr-slack-inbox with Spinel (https://github.com/matz/spinel) at the commit
in .spinel-version (d064b844ffec29200a3e74d0cb52c9a3bb261cee). Besides
herdr-slack-inbox itself (see LICENSE), it contains Spinel's runtime, code
Spinel generates, and the parts of the libraries below that Spinel compiles
into it. The Ruby script bin/herdr-slack-inbox does not include any of them.

